entries[207579] = { ["name"] = "Time-Thief's Gambit", ["text"] = "Binds when picked up\nUnique-Equipped\nTrinket\n+473 Intellect\nUse: \"Borrow\" power from an alternate timeline for personal gain, increasing your Haste by 1868 for 15 sec and triggering a Paradox 2 min later.\n\nIf the Paradox arrives, you will be frozen in time, completely unable to act or move for 5 sec. Killing enemies steals their remaining time to partially delay the Paradox by 15 sec, with major enemies restoring the timeline completely. (1 Min Cooldown)\nSell Price:" }
